# Product Specifications

Product specifications turn confirmed product intent into observable requirements and acceptance criteria. `docs/PRODUCT.md` remains the current overview; a spec records a bounded change and its lifecycle.

- Use `_template.md` for a new specification.
- Keep scanner observations Proposed until a project owner confirms them.
- Preserve Confirmed, Proposed, Open, and Sources when provenance matters.
- Supersede obsolete specifications instead of rewriting accepted history.
